<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/15/eng@/~cl_13__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "in subsection (2), by substituting for the words “priority date” the words “filing date and to any right of priority under section 27, if the right of priority is claimed,”. New section 26c"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/15/eng@> .
