<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/15/eng@/~cl_22> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 33a of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(3) No person in the employment of the Corporation shall be required to attend any court for the purpose of producing— (a) any document relating to a patent application or patent which may be obtained pursuant to the provisions of this Act; or (b) any document which is not to be made available to any third party in accordance with this Act.”. Amendment of section 33b"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/15/eng@> .
