<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/15/eng@/~cl_43> <https://schema.org/text> "The heading of Part XI of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the word “SURRENDER” the words “, OPPOSITION”. Amendment of section 55"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/15/eng@> .
