<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/15/eng@/~cl_55> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 78o of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) If the applicant designates Malaysia for the purpose of obtaining a patent under this Act for an international application that involves a micro-organism which is not available to the public and cannot be described in the application for a patent in such a manner as to enable the invention to be carried out by a person having ordinary skill in the art, a sample of such micro-organism shall be deposited by the applicant or any other person with a National Depositary Authority or an International Depositary Authority not later than the filing date of the international application.”. Amendment of section 79"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/15/eng@> .
