<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/15/eng@/~cl_69__subsec_10> <https://schema.org/text> "On the date of coming into operation of this Act, subsection 39(4) of the principal Act as amended in section 33 of this Act shall not affect any security interest transaction that have been entered into before the date of coming into operation of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/15/eng@> .
