<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/15/eng@/~cl_69__subsec_11__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "shall be deemed to have been published in the Official Journal and the new section 86a as introduced in section 64 of this Act shall apply accordingly without prejudice to any other written law; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/15/eng@> .
